  nameEnglish: Fuzil A32
  descriptionEnglish: The "Fuzil A32" is a high-powered rifle, designed specifically
    by humans to counter the threat of Holy Exorcists during The Old War. This weapon
    claimed the lives of six of the eight Holy Exorcists, the only ones left were
    Azaus and Dageron.
  nameChinese: "\u8D50\u798F\u9730\u5F39\u67AA"
  descriptionChinese: "\u8D50\u798F\u9730\u5F39\u67AA \u662F\u4E00\u79CD\u9AD8\u5A01\u529B\u6B65\u67AA\uFF0C\u4E13\u95E8\u7531\u4EBA\u7C7B\u8BBE\u8BA1\u6765\u5BF9\u6297\u65E7\u6218\u4E89\u4E2D\u7684\u795E\u5723\u9A71\u9B54\u5E08\u5A01\u80C1\u3002\u8FD9\u79CD\u6B66\u5668\u593A\u53BB\u4E86\u516B\u4F4D\u795E\u5723\u9A71\u9B54\u5E08\u4E2D\u516D\u4EBA\u7684\u751F\u547D\uFF0C\u4EC5\u6709\u7684\u4E24\u4F4D\u5E78\u5B58\u8005\u662FAzaus\u548CDageron\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Fuzil A32
  descriptionPortuguese: "O \"Fuzil A32\" \xE9 um rifle de alta pot\xEAncia, projetado
    especificamente por humanos para combater a amea\xE7a dos Exorcistas Sagrados
    durante A Guerra Antiga. Esta arma ceifou a vida de seis dos oito Exorcistas
    Sagrados, os \xFAnicos que restaram foram Azaus e Dageron."
  nameSpanish: Fuzil A32
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "El \u201CFuzil A32\u201D es un rifle de alta potencia
    dise\xF1ado espec\xEDficamente por los humanos para contrarrestar la amenaza
    de los exorcistas sagrados durante la Guerra Antigua. Esta arma se cobr\xF3 la
    vida de seis de los ocho exorcistas sagrados, los \xFAnicos que quedaron fueron
    Azaus y Dageron."
